      "standardized_narrative": "At 31 December 2021 the Syndicate's gross claims outstanding opening position was GBP 168.966m. During 2021 there was a gross strengthening (increase) in prior year provisions of GBP 31.711m (18.8% of opening gross reserves). The strengthening is driven by adverse prior-year development predominantly related to pandemic-era exposures and other prior-year uncertainties (notably reserves attaching to the discontinued Contingency book and long-tail Casualty exposures), with COVID-19 noted as accounting for a material proportion of net reserves. No single quantified named prior-year large loss is identified as the driver of the movement in the technical provisions note.",
